    {
      "text": "After Crane Crossing Neck dazes Dan Yu, Yu Fei returns his head to normal, leans back with his head buried between Dan Yu’s legs, and activates Six-nine Great Windmill. The two bodies tangle and spin like a windmill as they fall toward the ground.",
