      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Dan Yu feels the world spinning, grows dizzy and disoriented, and cannot react. Near the ground Yu Fei suddenly retreats. Dan Yu alone crashes head first into the brick floor, loses consciousness, and loses the match. The hosting elder announces Yu Fei as the new featherman king.",
